  "details": "Specific Shader is breaking in maps with this butterfly prefab/shader. https://booth.pm/en/items/4024643\n\nI can provide the shader or link to the map if it helps. \n\nhttps://vrch.at/yedvdnxk\n\nSteps to reproduce. Once you load into the map. \n\n1. Turn left and head down the path off the train platform.\n\n2. As you get close to park Butterfly Particles will render.\n\n3. Open menu / Camera menu and you'll notice the screen flickers and gets covered with what I believe are giant butterflies/artifacts from them. \n\nThis doesn't happen in Live only Open Beta. I think it has to do with either the Z Depth buffer or maybe GPU instance particles. It's just odd the menu breaks it.",
